            <ArticleTitle>Atherosclerosis and restenosis: reflections on the Lovastatin Restenosis Trial and Scandinavian Simvastatin Survival Study.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1036-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Atherosclerosis is related to serum lipids, whereas restenosis after coronary angioplasty is probably not, reflecting different pathophysiologies. Nonetheless, treatment of lipid disorders is appropriate after angioplasty.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
